  <name>MediaCopy 3000</name>
  <summary>Verified media offload and ASC MHL verification</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      MediaCopy 3000 copies media files from a source to one or more destinations and checks
      the copy with a hash. It writes an ASC Media Hash List (MHL) into each destination, so you can check the transfer again at a later time.
    </p>
  </description>
